    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this challenging puzzle game, you will be the guide of a swarm of up to 4 groups of bees. Your goal will be to collect pollen from the flowers and take it safe and sound to the honeycomb, facing different obstacles on the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control each group with the number keys and direct their movements with the directional arrows. Plan carefully and coordinate your swarm's movements to avoid dangers and overcome challenges in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you manage to complete all the levels and help the bees to maintain pollination in the world?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this challenging puzzle game, you will be the guide of a swarm of up to 4 groups of bees. Your goal will be to collect pollen from the flowers and take it safe and sound to the honeycomb, facing different obstacles on the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control each group with the number keys and direct their movements with the directional arrows. Plan carefully and coordinate your swarm's movements to avoid dangers and overcome challenges in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you manage to complete all the levels and help the bees to maintain pollination in the world?</p>",
    "short_description": "A defiant Bee puzzle where you will have to control different groups of bees by remote control to collect pollen, avoid obstacles and be able to take them to the honeycomb.",
